Subject: [PATCH 16/16] FreeChat: build against Tuwunel 2.0

Event, StateKey and the PDU types moved from tuwunel_core::matrix to the tuwunel_matrix crate; append_pdu now rebinds pdu_json after read_replaced, so the expiry annotation needs it mutable.
